cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ISOTP-C in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ISOTP-C"
abstract: >-
  Hardware-agnostic implementation of the ISO 15765-2 (ISO-TP) transport protocol
  for classical CAN in C11 for embedded systems: no heap, no RTOS, MISRA C:2012
  checked, 100 % line and branch coverage.
